<title>MALAYSIA: SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PETALING JAYA, Malaysia 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final</p>
<p>results in the women's world team squash championships on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>Australia beat Scotland 3-0</p>
<p>Michelle Martin beat Claire Waddell 9-4 9-5 9-4</p>
<p>Liz Irving beat Wendy Maitland 9-0 9-3 9-4</p>
<p>Carol Owens beat Pamela Nimmo 9-2 9-6</p>
<p>New Zealand beat Germany 2-1</p>
<p>Philippa Beams beat Sabine Schone 7-9 9-6 9-0 9-3</p>
<p>Leilani Marsh beat Sabine Baum 9-4 1-9 9-7 9-0</p>
<p>Sarah Cook lost to Silke Bartel 9-3 8-10 5-9</p>
<p>South Africa beat Netherlands 2-1</p>
<p>Claire Nitch beat Vanessa Atkinson 9-3 9-5 9-4</p>
<p>Chantal Clifton Parks lost to Nicole Benmer 1-9 1-9 9-6 10-8</p>
<p>9-10</p>
<p>Angelique Clifton Parks beat Denise Sommers 9-2 7-9 9-2 9-2</p>
<p>England beat Finland 3-0</p>
<p>Cassie Jackman beat Nina Taimiaho 9-1 9-1 9-0</p>
<p>Linda Charman beat Kia Passivirta 9-3 9-0 9-4</p>
<p>Fiona Geaves beat Pia Kaonnen 9-3 9-2</p>
</text>
